{
  "schema": "evidence_pack_scenarios_v1",
  "schema_version": 1,
  "_meta": {
    "purpose": "Single source of truth for evidence-pack scenarios and their assurance expectations.",
    "notes": [
      "Scenario IDs must match the directory names under <model>/reports/ in evidence pack runs.",
      "Strictness drives verdict gating: must_* scenarios are gating; informational scenarios never fail the pack.",
      "intent + primary_guard provide scenario utility metadata for maintainers and external evidence reviewers.",
      "Error scenarios may include generation.env to pin deterministic, scenario-specific injector settings.",
      "Optional sidecar probe artifacts (for example rmt_probe.json) can provide detector evidence when compare-mode guards are delta-internal.",
      "Scenarios can declare suites: [\"subset\", \"showcase\", \"workshop3\", \"full\", ...]; the suite filters to PACK_SUITE and writes the effective manifest to OUTPUT_DIR/state/scenarios.json."
    ]
  },
